    "description": {
      "value": "This special blend of potent herbs comes in the form of a compact ball that allows it to be held in the mouth, where it remains for 1 hour. An energizing pill has a bitter taste at first, but the longer one lets it soak, the more complex and sweet its flavor grows. It heightens your reactions, granting you a +2 item bonus to initiative rolls with Perception. Reduce the value of the condition you just gained by 1; if this reduces the value to 0, you don't gain the triggering condition."
